# "When this creature enters, you may sacrifice another creature or enchantment. When you do, this creature deals 2 damage to any
# target" (CR 701.21a, 603.12, 120.2b). Bot1 sacrifices its Fastbond (an enchantment) as the enter trigger resolves, and the reflexive
# trigger that follows deals exactly 2 to Bot2. Neither the Ripper itself ("another") nor a Mox (an artifact, not a creature or an
# enchantment) may be sacrificed, and a Mox is not a legal target (it is not a creature, player, planeswalker or battle).

